Subject: [PATCH] native: original material array ownership and GX FIFO transport
Upstream-base: 9046e67aa2077a7eb4ed6e28c9df3c1d3b368f84
Prepared-predecessor: complete 281-source series

Use canonical host GX declarations and allocation-owned extent/endian metadata.
Preserve every source address, fixed stride, index loop, count and word order.
Native GXEnd closes the original primitive on the host encoder. Crystal
render uses the canonical matrix declarations. No shader/readiness changes.

